1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:05,683
Hi! This is ScamKavach — a free scam checker for every Indian phone.

2
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:11,842
In 2024, Indians lost ₹22,845 crore to cyber fraud —

3
00:00:11,842 --> 00:00:16,326
three times more than the year before.

4
00:00:16,326 --> 00:00:19,397
Over 36 lakh fraud complaints were filed.

5
00:00:19,397 --> 00:00:23,817
And half of UPI fraud victims never even report it.

6
00:00:24,317 --> 00:00:27,729
ScamKavach is simple. Paste any suspicious SMS,

7
00:00:27,729 --> 00:00:30,144
WhatsApp message or link.

8
00:00:31,317 --> 00:00:34,782
In one tap, you see whether it's a scam — and exactly why.

9
00:00:34,782 --> 00:00:38,153
Here it caught a fake SBI link pretending to be the bank,

10
00:00:38,153 --> 00:00:42,656
a threat to block the account, and panic words like “immediately”.

11
00:00:43,158 --> 00:00:46,288
Then it tells you what to do: don't click, don't pay,

12
00:00:46,288 --> 00:00:49,369
never share an OTP, and report the sender.

13
00:00:49,869 --> 00:00:54,160
It's built for Bharat. The whole app works in Hindi and Marathi.

14
00:00:54,659 --> 00:00:57,313
This is the UPI refund trick. Remember:

15
00:00:57,313 --> 00:01:00,976
you never need your UPI PIN to receive money.

16
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:04,762
Here's a fake “digital arrest” threat in Marathi.

17
00:01:04,762 --> 00:01:08,717
There is no such thing as a digital arrest — and ScamKavach says so,

18
00:01:08,717 --> 00:01:10,887
in the user's own language.

19
00:01:11,388 --> 00:01:16,901
It doesn't cry wolf. A genuine bank OTP message is recognised as normal.

20
00:01:16,901 --> 00:01:21,895
57 automated tests check both scams and real messages.

21
00:01:22,396 --> 00:01:25,084
Every scam result has a one-tap WhatsApp alert,

22
00:01:25,084 --> 00:01:28,201
so the warning spreads faster than the scam.

23
00:01:28,704 --> 00:01:33,524
Already lost money? Call 1930, the national cyber crime helpline,

24
00:01:33,524 --> 00:01:35,533
right from the app.

25
00:01:36,032 --> 00:01:40,493
Four golden rules stay on screen, to stop fraud before it starts.

26
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:44,178
And it's private. Your message never leaves your phone.

27
00:01:44,178 --> 00:01:48,532
No login, no server — and it works even on low-end phones.

28
00:01:49,033 --> 00:01:54,609
Try it free at blop77.github.io/ScamKavach. Stay safe —

29
00:01:54,609 --> 00:01:59,062
and if you're ever scammed, call 1930.

